1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:01,710
(Raj:)Good night, Sheldon.

2
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:03,110
(Sheldon:)Wait. Not yet.

3
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:04,580
(Sheldon:)We still have to go over
safety procedures.

4
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:07,620
(Sheldon:)Now, the apartment has three
emergency exits located

5
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:09,320
(Sheldon:)here, here, and here.

6
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:11,750
(Sheldon:)In the event of a power outage,

7
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:15,190
(Sheldon:)luminous paint will guide you
to the nearest exit.

8
00:00:15,870 --> 00:00:16,900
(Raj:)You're kidding.

9
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:29,770
(Sheldon:)I never kid about safety.

10
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:43,150
(Leonard:)What are you doing here?

11
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:44,520
(Raj:)I was sleeping.

12
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:45,720
(Leonard:)In my bed?

13
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,420
(Raj:)Well, I would've slept
in my own bed,

14
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:49,490
(Raj:)but it was being used
to bring shame to my family.

15
00:00:50,630 --> 00:00:54,190
(Raj:)And the memory
of Gene Roddenberry.

